 ('Choosing the right size', '<p>Pick a weekly amount you could still save in your worst normal week. If the challenge only works in good weeks, it will break the first time something goes wrong. It is better to finish a small challenge than to quit a big one.</p><p>For irregular income, choose the flat style with a modest amount, then add extra in good weeks as a bonus.</p>', 'Example only. A tricycle driver in Tarlac with uneven daily income picks a flat &#8369;100 a week, and adds &#8369;50 extra in weeks with a big fiesta or school opening rush.'),
